  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civic Engagement Alliance (CEA) in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description akvo:type="6" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICCO has the lead role in organizing the Convening &amp; Convincing (or Civic Engagement Alliance) program in Ethiopia. Our role in the program is supporting program development and implementation by partner organizations for the two selected pathways of change; Inclusive &amp; Sustainable food system and economic empowerment for smallholder farmers. ICCO coordinates research, dialogue capacity building and dialogue of  several partners to empower women, persons with disabilities and potato and malt barley smallholder farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICCO has the lead role in organizing the Convening &amp; Convincing program in Ethiopia. Our own role in the program is supporting program development and implementation by partner organizations for the two selected pathways of change; Inclusive &amp; Sustainable food system and economic empowerment for smallholder farmers. ICCO coordinates research, dialogue capacity building and dialogue of  several partners to empower women, persons with disabilities and potato and malt barley smallholder farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
